msgstr "變更你在聊天中的顯示名稱。變更生效前會出現確認對話框。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/nick.ex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Change your display name. A confirmation dialog appears before the change takes effect.\nRules: 1-16 characters, no spaces. Must start with a letter or [ ] \\ ^ _ { | }.\nAllowed characters: letters, numbers, [ ] \\ ^ _ ` { | } and hyphens.\nCannot change to your current nickname or one already in use."
msgstr ""
"Change your display name. A confirmation dialog appears before the change takes effect.\n"
"Rules: 1-16 characters, no spaces. Must start with a letter or [ ] \\ ^ _ { | }.\n"
"Allowed characters: letters, numbers, [ ] \\ ^ _ ` { | } and hyphens.\n"
"Cannot change to your current nickname or one already in use."

