msgstr "停止執行中的計時器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/unignore.ex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Stop ignoring a user you previously blocked, making their messages visible again."
msgstr "停止忽略你先前封鎖的使用者,讓對方的訊息再次可見。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/unignore.ex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Stop ignoring a user you previously blocked, making their messages visible again.\nNickname is required. Use /ignore with no args to see your ignore list first."
