#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/ascii.ex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open ASCII Art, to turn a word, a picture or a Hex Paint drawing into text art in mIRC colours and post it to a channel."
msgstr "打開 ASCII 藝術,以mIRC顏色將一個字,一個圖片或一個Hex Paint繪製成文本藝術並張貼到一個頻道."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/paint.ex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/paint.ex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Hex Paint, the pixel drawing program, to draw a picture and post it to a channel."
msgstr "開啟 Hex Paint 像素繪圖程式，繪製圖片並發布到頻道。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/radio.ex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/radio.ex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Hex Radio, the internet radio player, to listen to stations from around the world."
msgstr "開啟 Hex Radio 網路廣播播放器，收聽來自世界各地的電台。"
